<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 26,000 T white, raw sugar.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 26,000 T white, raw sugar.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation for Chemicals and Foostuffs (GEZA) has re-issued a tender to buy 13,000 tonnes of white sugar and 13,000 tonnes of raws, a GEZA spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He said August 5 was set as the final date to receive price offers and that the two amounts should be shipped in September.</p>
<p>Results of the tender would be made on August 6, the official said.</p>
<p>GEZA passed on two previous tenders to buy the same quantity as price offers did not meet its requirements.</p>
</text>
